      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T09:39:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have reviewed all the tests, and the only two that interact with the code affected by this change are:\n\n* lookUpByPreferredEmail\n* searchForSecondaryEmailRequiresModifyAccountPermission\n\nThese tests include checks related to enforcing case sensitivity for email addresses. However, this is not the primary focus of the tests; rather, it is part of a broader test logic.\n\nNotably, these two tests utilize the `Emails#getAccountFor` method and the `GerritApi.Accounts` APIs. Both are thoroughly tested in the new tests I have added, which explicitly cover both case-sensitive and case-insensitive scenarios.",
